                    insight_secured:        `Funding secured: you behaved as an owner-investor — a benefits-led BCR above 1.80, worst-case exposure cut through risk allocation and staged gates, and a structure that absorbed the live shock. Value was won in the owner decisions, not in construction.`,
                    insight_exposed:        `You hit the ≥1.80 BCR, but your worst-case exposure is still high — the delivery model or the staging left too much overrun risk on the owner. A fundable case sitting on a fragile structure.`,
